    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ranen kwoŋ yeyo pa Abraham",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo wanowaci aŋo kwoŋ Abraham, kwari wan i del? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bedi kwany woko banja kwoŋe cungo kwoŋ gigipiny ma go otimo, di go onyalo bedo kodi yumirok, to go kinyal yumere ruwaŋ Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.15.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 15:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 3:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kere randik waco aŋo? Ni, “Abraham oyeyo Were, aka ro yeyo pere Were okwano go paka ŋat'otire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhano ka tiyo iculo go kemba ma kiter paka mic, to paka gima go otiyo rigo ayin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka dhano kikethi geno kwoŋ tic pere, to ketho i yeyo Were ma kwanyo woko banja kwoŋ ji ayino, kiti yeyo no miyo ikwano rigo tiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a dwoŋ gima Daudi owaco munyo luwo kwoŋ kisangala pa ŋata Were jolo paka ŋat'otire ma k'okwano tic ma go otieko timo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Silwany ma Daudi oluwo kwoŋe me bedo apa jom'othumere kende? Be. Bedo apa joma jok'othumere bende, rupiri watieko nyutho wac wok i randik ni, “Abraham oyeyo Were, aka ro yeyo pere Were okwano go paka ŋat'otire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gime otimere keraŋo? Otimere mafodi, kosa munyo Abraham otieko thumere? Mafodi, makiweno rumacen ma thumirok pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 17:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Othum go rumacen paka ranyuth ma ridho ni ro yeyo pere munyo fodi go k'othumere am'omiyo Were okwano go paka ŋat'otire. Meno am'omiyo Abraham obedo ba joma yeyo Were ma cuny, ma Were jolo jo paka jom'otire, kada jok'othumere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go obedo ba jom'othumere bende, ki ni rupiri othum jo, to rupiri jonitie i kiti kwo ma yeyo ma Abraham cango obed'iye munyo fodi k'othumi go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cikirok pa Were ijolo wok i yeyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
