        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 3:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno cikirok no cungo kwoŋ yeyo, ŋey wothenere kwoŋ nema pa Were aka womiy nyikway Abraham je, aka ki nyaka joma jokuro Cik kende, to joma joyeyo paka cango Abraham bende oyeyo. Ato Abraham obedo ba wajoje ma cuny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 17:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "paka ndiko waco ni, “Alokin ba nonin mathoth.” Aka cikirok no otimere bongi Were won ma Abraham oyeyo; Were ma cerino jom'otho, ma or pere miyo gimoro m'oyido ongoye cako bedo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.15.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 15:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham oyeyo aka ogeno, munyo geno oyido ongoye kiri kony, am'omiyo go olokere Ba nonin mathoth paka ndiko waco ni, “Nyikwayin jolatiŋo piny pa kweth micala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 17:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oro pere oyido cegin romo miya acel, to yeyo pere k'omojere munyo go oparo kwoŋ delkwoŋe m'onwaŋo cal p'otieko tho, kosa munyo oneno ni Sara oyido kinyal limo nyithindho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeyo pere k'orumo, aka go k'oganagana kwoŋ cikirok pa Were; yeyo pere opoŋo kwoŋ go meni, to foyo Were, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rupiri go oyido oridho kicutho ni Were bino timo gima go otieko ciko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno am'omiyo, ro yeyo pa Abraham, Were okwano go paka ŋat'otire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac me ni, “Okwan go.” K'ondiki ri Abraham kende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ondiki riwan bende m'ibino kwano wan paka jom'otire, wan ma wayeyo Ŋat'ocerino Yesu Rwodhiwan kwoŋ jom'otho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
